# Deny by default, as at the repository root. The ios/ and android/ projects generated by
# prebuild, node_modules, Expo caches and local env files are all covered by not being
# listed, so none of them has to be enumerated here.
#
# Sources are admitted by extension rather than by name: a new screen or component in
# this demo app should not need a line in this file. Directories are not matched by those
# patterns, so anything a tool drops in a folder of its own stays out.
/*

!/assets/

!/*.js
!/*.json
!/*.ts
!/*.tsx
!/.gitignore
